    "content": "<style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><!--[if mso]><style>.button-table { padding: 12px 0 }</style><![endif]--><style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-layout-block.ck-layout-stack td {\n          display: block !important;\n          width: 100% !important;\n          padding: 0 !important;\n        }\n        .ck-column.ck-column-stack {\n          margin-bottom: 32px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><div><style>\n  .email {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n</style><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:40px;margin-left:auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"640\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-default\" style=\"padding-top:36px;padding-right:36px;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:640px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center;table-layout:fixed;float:none\" class=\"email-image\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><figure style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;display:inline-block;max-width:375px;width:100%\"><div style=\"display:block\"><img src=\"https://embed.filekitcdn.com/e/sQPykcbSSsHRVZVvj5Qcv9/uLb6vb1YF4w4f1rqqaETVi\" width=\"375\" height=\"auto\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;width:375px;height:auto;object-fit:contain\"/></div><figcaption style=\"text-align:center;display:none\">\u200b</figcaption></figure></td></tr></tbody></table><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;list-style-position:inside\"><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Inspirational Quote </span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Upcoming Events/Announcements</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Stay out of Excell Hell</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Business Partners Corner</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Today&#x27;s Playbook - A deep dive for the modern finance leader</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>The FP&amp;A Guy&#x27;s Tech Tips</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Ron&#x27;s Recommendation</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Finance Funnies</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Free Goodies</span></li></ul><hr style=\"width:52%;height:3px;alignment:center;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:48px;border:none;background-color:#666;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto\"/><h1 style=\"font-family:Charter, Georgia, Times, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-size:36px;color:#11363F;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">Inspirational Quote</h1><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><div style=\"padding:10px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0;border-left-color:#000000;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"blockquotes\"><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">&quot;Change can be tough, but I&#x27;ve never heard anyway say it wasn&#x27;t worth it.&quot;</div><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">\u200b</div><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">- Carol Dweck, author of Mindset</div></div><h1 style=\"font-family:Charter, Georgia, Times, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-size:36px;color:#11363F;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">Upcoming Events</h1><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><hr style=\"width:53%;height:3px;alignment:center;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:48px;border:none;background-color:#666;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto\"/><h1 style=\"font-family:Charter, Georgia, Times, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-size:36px;color:#11363F;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">Stay out of Excel Hell</h1><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">One of my favorite Excel functions is Unique.  This is a function that was added to Excel when they created Dynamic Arrays and requires Excel 365, Excel Online, or Excel 2021 in order to use it. In this section we have included a video explaining how unique works, along with the formula syntax and an example. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><!--[if mso]><table><tr><td width=\"800\"><![endif]--><a href=\"https://youtu.be/9H1gKN9mU70?si=W98UAq5V2IsgLcen\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;border:0;text-decoration:none\"><img alt=\"video preview\" src=\"https://functions-js.convertkit.com/playbutton?play=%23324C85&accent=%23ffffff&thumbnailof=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2F9H1gKN9mU70%3Fsi%3DW98UAq5V2IsgLcen&width=480&height=270&fit=contain\" width=\"500\" height=\"281.25\" style=\"display:block;border-radius:4px\"/>\u200b</a><!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><!--[if !mso]>--><table width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><a class=\"email-button\" href=\"https://www.thefpandaguy.com/excel-files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"border-color:#11363F;background-color:#11363F;box-sizing:border-box;border-style:solid;color:#fdf7f7;display:inline-block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 20px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:16px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px;border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px\"><strong>Download the Practice Worksheet</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table><!--<![endif]--><!--[if mso]><table class=\"button-table\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#11363F\" style=\"background-color:#11363F;overflow:hidden;padding:12px 20px\"><a class=\"email-button\" href=\"https://www.thefpandaguy.com/excel-files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"background-color:inherit;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;border-style:solid;margin:0;color:#fdf7f7;font-size:16px\" data-ck-element=\"button\"><strong>Download the Practice Worksheet</strong></a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><![endif]--><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Unique Function - </strong>Returns a unique list of values from a range/list. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Syntax: </strong>Unique (array, [by_col],[exatly_once])</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Array </strong>- This is your data set, data array or range from which to return unique elements.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>[by_col]</strong>- This is an optional argument that requires a value indicating how to compare the data.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>TRUE</strong> - Will compare columns against each other and return the unique columns.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>FALSE</strong> - Will compare rows against each other and return unique rows. By default if you do not enter this argument it assumes false.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>[exactly_once] </strong>- This is an optional argument and will return only a unique data set for items that only appear once in the data.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>TRUE</strong> - Returns a unique list from the rows or columns that only appear once in the data set.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>FALSE </strong>- will return a unique list regardless of how many times something appears in the dataset. This is the default operation, and if you enter, nothing assumes false. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Note: [] = </strong>Optional input not required.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Example: </strong>Assume we want to get a unique list of Invoice Dates for the customer Delta from the below dataset. If we were in a version of Excel without unique odds are we would use the remove duplicate function. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">You would go to the data bar and highlight remove duplicates.</p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center;table-layout:fixed;float:none\" class=\"email-image\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><figure style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;display:inline-block;max-width:500px;width:100%\"><div style=\"display:block\"><img src=\"https://embed.filekitcdn.com/e/sQPykcbSSsHRVZVvj5Qcv9/axRKRFWpNxqbPKePL9sqyd/email\" width=\"500\" height=\"auto\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;width:500px;height:auto;object-fit:contain\"/></div><figcaption style=\"text-align:center;display:block\">Figure 1: Remove Duplicates from Data Menu</figcaption></figure></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">You would then select the data you want to remove duplicates, press ok and it would remove your duplicates.  </p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center;table-layout:fixed;float:none\" class=\"email-image\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><figure style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;display:inline-block;max-width:300px;width:100%\"><div style=\"display:block\"><img src=\"https://embed.filekitcdn.com/e/sQPykcbSSsHRVZVvj5Qcv9/nSoiLybVJCqV6xFW4KNCqp/email\" width=\"300\" height=\"auto\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;width:300px;height:auto;object-fit:contain\"/></div><figcaption style=\"text-align:center;display:block\">Figure 2: Remove Duplicates </figcaption></figure></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">I am here to tell you that if you are using this method, a better way exists.  Let us try removing the duplicates with the unique function. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">We would type =Unique( and then highlight the invoice dates we want to create a unique list from. See image below:</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center;table-layout:fixed;float:none\" class=\"email-image\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><figure style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;display:inline-block;max-width:200px;width:100%\"><div style=\"display:block\"><img src=\"https://embed.filekitcdn.com/e/sQPykcbSSsHRVZVvj5Qcv9/gRTTNnLFm9fqwgTd5dRUuv/email\" width=\"200\" height=\"auto\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;width:200px;height:auto;object-fit:contain\"/></div><figcaption style=\"text-align:center;display:block\">Figure 3: Unique Formula</figcaption></figure></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">This is all that is required for the formula all other steps are optional.   In our cell, we would have Unique(E4:22) and the following results would be displayed. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center;table-layout:fixed;float:none\" class=\"email-image\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><figure style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;display:inline-block;max-width:200px;width:100%\"><div style=\"display:block\"><img src=\"https://embed.filekitcdn.com/e/sQPykcbSSsHRVZVvj5Qcv9/5c9sQD3gqsnpgRdCZAaRxS/email\" width=\"200\" height=\"auto\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;width:200px;height:auto;object-fit:contain\"/></div><figcaption style=\"text-align:center;display:block\">Figure 4: Unique Formula Dataset</figcaption></figure></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">For details on how the other optional arguments work, please watch the full video above.  If you are not using unique, encourage you to use it as it is a great way to get unique lists from data sources without having to use remove duplicates, and if you structure the data right every time you add more data to your list, the formula will automatically adjust and update the unique list without you having to do anything. </p><hr style=\"width:53%;height:3px;alignment:center;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:48px;border:none;background-color:#666;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto\"/><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><h1 style=\"font-family:Charter, Georgia, Times, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-size:36px;color:#11363F;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">Business Partners Corner</h1><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center;table-layout:fixed;float:none\" class=\"email-image\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><figure style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;display:inline-block;max-width:275px;width:100%\"><div style=\"display:block\"><img src=\"https://embed.filekitcdn.com/e/sQPykcbSSsHRVZVvj5Qcv9/jn9uJuijazMdGm9tQDFueR\" width=\"275\" height=\"auto\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;border-