n</a>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>\u200b<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/adamshiltontech/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Adam Shilton | LinkedIn</a>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>\u200b<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/gbhopperiii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Glenn Hopper | LinkedIn</a>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>\u200b<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/ai-finance-club/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Finance Club: Overview | LinkedIn</a>\u200b</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Check them out and start learning from the great content they provide, and in the next letter, I will share several Language Learning Modules (LLM&#x27;s) you can try for free. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><hr style=\"width:53%;height:3px;alignment:center;margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:48px;border:none;background-color:#666;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto\"/><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Ro